            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 37,
              "start": 37
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to The Clearing House Association, the Clearing House contends that Section\u202f484 pre\u2011empts the State\u2019s investigative and enforcement machinery."
      }
